></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，运算族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\">\\(\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\\)</span>，关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A^2)\">\\(\\mathcal P(A^2)\\)</span>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a92e0473734a9033\" href=\"?note=a92e0473734a9033\" title=\"56-df-interpretation-order\">56-df-interpretation-order</a> 的诱导解释关系只在这些合格代数参数上求值。解释序与归约序、终止性的接口分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4193949606379958\" href=\"?note=4193949606379958\" title=\"56-thm-interpretation-order-reduction-order\">56-thm-interpretation-order-reduction-order</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"895d3a7bab17e118\" href=\"?note=895d3a7bab17e118\" title=\"56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order\">56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\\iff\n\\exists A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\exists I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq A^2\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\\iff\n\\exists A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\exists I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq A^2\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{WFMonotoneAlg}_\\Sigma(A,I,Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(R,&gt;_{(A,I,Q)}^{\\Sigma,V})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Theorem 6.2.2 的双向结论。正向构造 A=T，I(f) 为项构造子，Q 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^+\">\\(\\to_R^+\\)</span>；替换恰是 A 中赋值，规则的所有实例下降。反向由解释序为 reduction order 及规则兼容推出终止。已核对 pp.184–185 的陈述和证明。该存在性刻画不提供发现 A 或 I 的通用算法。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.2.2–6.2.4，印刷页 184–185。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-interpretation-order","status":"resolved","id":"a92e0473734a9033","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-interpretation-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-interpretation-order-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"4193949606379958","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-interpretation-order-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"895d3a7bab17e118","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-termination-by-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-interpretation-order","status":"resolved","id":"a92e0473734a9033","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。载体存在量词在集合论元语言中遍历非空集合 $A$，运算族 $I$ 遍历 $\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}}$，关系 $Q$ 遍历 